    "sig": "df7306cedd",
    "ms": 2195,
    "file": "61f19958b305.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Let’s fill my explorer journal!",
    "voice": "peru-luna",
    "sig": "df7306cedd",
    "ms": 2637,
    "file": "2185ce6da1d6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the warm hat to help Luna!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2837,
    "file": "ce459dbf9ae5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Where shall we explore?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2010,
    "file": "8bfc681f8afa.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Another discovery, Kaylee!",
    "voice": "peru-luna",
    "sig": "df7306cedd",
    "ms": 2047,
    "file": "4226341b5295.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "This discovery opens soon!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2265,
    "file": "2f2e77cc9db5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Our expedition opens soon!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2554,
    "file": "d95991bb1ba0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the map to explore!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2463,
    "file": "1cc2b2e67883.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hee hee! My fluffy ears!",
    "voice": "peru-luna",
    "sig": "df7306cedd",
    "ms": 2025,
    "file": "d7e39c32e27e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "I love exploring with you!",
    "voice": "peru-luna",
    "sig": "df7306cedd",
    "ms": 1692,
    "file": "0e2ac20f8ff7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Brrr! It’s chilly up here!",
    "voice": "peru-luna",
    "sig": "df7306cedd",
    "ms": 2714,
    "file": "87c312c04bdd.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Give Luna the warm hat!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2056,
    "file": "01d4e15aaa93.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Wrap Luna in the scarf!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2310,
    "file": "ff88df3b0393.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Put on Luna’s warm jacket!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2561,
    "file": "b341bb0e9dd6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pull the zipper up!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1847,
    "file": "7aa230870fbc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Cozy ears!",
    "voice": "peru-luna",
    "sig": "df7306cedd",
    "ms": 1310,
    "file": "2d47ea286118.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Soft and snuggly!",
    "voice": "peru-luna",
    "sig": "df7306cedd",
    "ms": 1642,
    "file": "7daaa86390d9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Find the warm, woolly one!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2252,
    "file": "8813005e2842.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Try the glowing spot!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1826,
    "file": "b164f383fcc0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pull up to the glowing star!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2601,
    "file": "09d77fb2fc9f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ready to explore, Kaylee!",
    "voice": "peru-luna",
    "sig": "df7306cedd",
    "ms": 1646,
    "file": "4b656d6bd7e7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Warm hat!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1364,
    "file": "8f91b3007ccd.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Scarf!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 750,
    "file": "a2a4891e3b44.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Warm jacket!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1363,
    "file": "57ee8973f827.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Great exploring, Kaylee!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2343,
    "file": "4b9016dbc543.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Alpaca sticker! Alpacas have soft fleece!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4274,
    "file": "af105e4d492d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Peru is in South America!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2450,
    "file": "a71a5a4d0354.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hola means hello in Spanish!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2659,
    "file": "713ee53c4216.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "People also speak Quechua and Aymara!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3513,
    "file": "4bc083f4dc3f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Peru has coast, mountains, and rainforest!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3806,
    "file": "f90c7c464780.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Alpacas have soft fleece!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2891,
    "file": "66f97b46e16a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Red, white, red! Peru’s flag!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3791,
    "file": "69e954f7f25c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "This is Peru! Tap a picture to explore.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3876,
    "file": "e6add4cd764f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Kaylee, you did it! You won the Peru Explorer trophy!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 5235,
    "file": "9ceadef5975f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Kaylee, Peru Explorer! From Peru.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
